Portions of this repository build upon the following works, retained under
their respective licenses:

  • Retsinas et al., "Best Practices for a Handwritten Text Recognition
    system" (DAS 2022) — reference implementation of the CNN-RNN baseline
    was used as a starting point.
  • Darcet et al., "Vision Transformers Need Registers" (ICLR 2024) — the
    register-token mechanism is adapted for the CTC sequence-labelling
    setting used here.
  • Beyond-Memorization: Training-Free Style Mixing for Handwriting
    Generation (ICDAR 2025) — the official reference implementation is
    cloned separately (see external/) under its own license.

